"Hide Personal Details from Cloud AI" = "对云端 AI 隐藏个人信息";
"Before anything goes to Claude or a custom server, Parrot swaps emails, phone numbers, card numbers and IBANs for placeholders like [EMAIL_1], then puts the real values back in what comes back. Local Ollama gets the text as is." = "在任何内容发送给 Claude 或自定义服务器之前，Parrot 会把邮箱、电话号码、银行卡号和 IBAN 替换成 [EMAIL_1] 这样的占位符，收到回复后再换回真实内容。本地 Ollama 收到的是原文。";
"Hide emails, phone, card and bank numbers" = "隐藏邮箱、电话、银行卡号和账号";
"Hide people's names too" = "同时隐藏人名";
"Uses Apple's on-device name detection. It can miss names or catch a product name, and the AI's answers get vaguer." = "使用 Apple 的本机人名识别。它可能漏掉人名或误伤产品名，AI 的回答也会变得更笼统。";
"Recording Consent" = "录音告知";
"Many places require telling everyone a call is recorded. The Consent button on the call screen copies this notice to paste in the call chat (or notes that everyone agreed out loud) and keeps the record with the meeting." = "很多地方要求告知所有人通话正在录音。通话界面上的“告知”按钮会复制这段告知文字，方便你粘贴到会议聊天里（或记录大家已口头同意），并随会议保存记录。";
"Notice" = "告知内容";
"Remind me at the start of every call" = "每次通话开始时提醒我";
"The Consent button stays orange until you've used it." = "在你使用之前，“告知”按钮会一直显示为橙色。";
"Automatic Clean-up" = "自动清理";
